OL,3,GNEWSA'I sell crime novels - now I'm a
OL,4,Acharacter in one'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the owner of a bookshop specialising
OL,7,Fin "whodunnits", Isla Coole is no
OL,8,Fstranger to the world of crime fiction.
OL,10,FNow, she is at the heart of a murder
OL,11,Fmystery story herself after she won a
OL,12,Fcompetition to have a character named
OL,13,Fafter her in the latest book by
OL,14,Fbestselling author Janice Hallett, The
OL,15,FSilent Appeal.
OL,17,FThe 46-year-old opened her York shop,
OL,18,FCriminally Good Books, on Colliergate
OL,19,Fin 2024.
